10 DIM V(1500):GOSUB 1000: REM SETUP
20 FOR S = 1 TO LS: REM FOR EACH STEP SIZE = 1, 2, 3, ...LAST STEP SIZE
30 GOSUB 100: REM WILL STEP BACKWARDS TO A POSITION NOT VISITED OR FORWARD?
40 GOSUB 200: REM DRAW ARC AND MOVE ACCORDINGLY
50 NEXT S
60 END
100 REM WILL STEP BACKWARDS TO A POSITION NOT VISITED OR FORWARD?
110 PP = P - S: REM NEXT POSITION (TRY BACKWARDS)
120 IF PP >= 0 THEN IF NOT V(PP) THEN RETURN : REM BACKWARDS OK
130 PP = P + S: REM BACKWARDS FAILED, MOVE FORWARD INSTEAD
140 RETURN
200 REM DRAW ARC AND MOVE ACCORDINGLY
210 IF PP > P THEN IF (S AND 1) <> 0 THEN GOTO 270: REM ODD STEP?
220 IF (S AND 1) > 0 THEN AA = 0: AB = -PI: SA = -1: GOTO 300: REM BACKWARDS, ODD STEP
230 AA = 0: AB = PI: SA = 1: GOTO 300: REM BACKWARDS, EVEN STEP
260 AA = PI: AB = 0: SA = -1: GOTO 300: REM FORWARD, EVEN STEP
270 AA = -PI: AB = 0: SA = 1
300 REM DRAW ARC
310 CX = X0 + (P + PP) / 2 * SC: CY = Y0: REM CENTER COORDINATES
320 R = ABS(P - PP) / 2 * SC: REM RADIUS
330 FOR A = AA TO AB STEP SA * PI / 4 / R
340 X = CX + COS(A) * R: Y = CY - SIN(A) * R: REM POINT OF THE ARC
350 IF X >= XA AND X <= XB AND Y >= YA AND Y <= YB THEN PSET (X, Y): REM PLOT IF WITHIN SCREEN
360 NEXT A
400 REM CONCLUDE MOVE
410 P = PP: REM UPDATE CURRENT POSITION
420 V(P) = YES: REM MARK CURRENT POSITION AS VISITED
430 RETURN
1000 REM SETUP
1010 YES = -1: NO = 0: REM BOOLEAN VALUES
1020 : REM INCREASED ARRAY SIZE TO PREVENT OUT OF BOUNDS ERRORS
