1120 X0 = 10: Y0 = INT(YZ / 2): REM ORIGIN COORDINATES (SHIFTED SLIGHTLY RIGHT)
1130 SC = 3: REM SCALE FACTOR ADJUSTED FOR THE WIDER SCREEN
1140 PIr = 3.14159265
1200 SCREEN 2: CLS: REM GW-BASIC MONOCHROME HIGH-RES MODE
